# Godiva Device OpenSCAD - Claude

This test generates OpenSCAD models using Claude.

## Claude Generation

```claude, model=claude-haiku-4-5, context=lib/, log=output/godiva-claude.log
Based on the technical documentation provided, generate a complete OpenSCAD script for a Godiva device.

Requirements:
- Use proper OpenSCAD syntax
- Include parametric design with variables
- Add comments explaining each section
- Make dimensions based on specifications from the documentation
- Include mounting points and connection interfaces
- Use modules for reusability
- Include three parts: core assembly, housing/shell, and control panel
- Add a final assembly module showing all parts in position

Generate only the OpenSCAD code, no explanations outside comments.
```
